        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Virginia Ruzici, Andy Murray, Guillermo Vilas\n- Events: 1980 Austrian Open\n- Places: Romania, Scotland\n- Roles: professional tennis players\n\nFacts:\n- Virginia Ruzici was born on 31 January 1955 and is a former professional tennis player from Romania.\n- Andy Murray was born on 15 May 1987 and is a British professional tennis player from Scotland.\n- At the 1980 Austrian Open, first-seeded Guillermo Vilas won the men's singles title and $13,000 in first-prize money.\n- At the 1980 Austrian Open, Virginia Ruzici won the women's singles event.\n- Andy Murray was ranked world No. 3 in men's singles at the time described in the chunk.",
